  "type": "function",
  "function": {
    "name": "post_message",
    "arguments": {
      "text": "Round 5 Planning phase complete. My bid of 5.09 is submitted. Awaiting team's strategy adjustment before proceeding further.",
      "channel": "private"
    }
  }
}
```
